  m_Name: Hard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RhythmRehab.SongChart
  description: "Prelude in E minor \u2014 Hard. Alternating piano-tile-style bursts,
    lighter musical phrases and no-input rests. Burst taps follow MIDI attacks as
    close as 0.12 seconds apart; lighter passages use varied spacing. Chords share
    one height, and holds finish before rest sections. Four-second audio lead-in."
